{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_cathy_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_cathy_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"日色温柔","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cathy_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"3d0c311a79824eb96306af2bf361c6448aa29c8afab528ba2f24e3369fe3a8cb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g6_dusklentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳......凯瑟琳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉拉？你有事找我吗，这么早......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你肯定很忙吧？我就怕去你家里找不到你......你看，还好我来得早，不然真要扑空了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忙什么，都退下来了。我只是去买这周的菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你的互助会怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......就是为了那边的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳，我能不能，求你帮个忙呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你一起去杂货店吧？也不会耽误你很久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，正好你也帮我看看换什么牌子的清洁剂，之前我买的那种，擦水垢很费力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你是不是还在用老汉克牌？他们换配方啦，价格是便宜了点，但效果和以前没得比......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等会到店里再看吧。先说说你互助会的事？你需要我做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你也知道，我们互助会是帮单亲家庭带小孩子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来只是大家凑在一起安排下时间，谁有连班或者夜班，就把小孩子送到有空的人家里待个半天一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年都是这样过来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有些年头了，难为你做到现在。以前我就佩服你能带那么多孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那时候我们家约翰多亏了互助会里的人帮忙。受了别人的恩惠，之后当然就该我帮别人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是战争结束之后，单亲家庭......一下子多了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送来照看的小孩子也变多了，要还是像以前那样，谁的家里也挤不下呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说让小孩子有地方写作业了，有的屋子里连椅子都不够坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就商量着，是不是一起凑点钱，租个大小合适的、固定的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钱够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，毕竟人也变多了，大家各自出一点点，还是能凑出个差不多的数目......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是这个地方......本来是伊安和我一起在找......可我们，我们吵了一架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊安已经四天没来互助会了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，算了吧伊安......人家不租了，我们又能有什么法子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再找找就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个工厂老板太不讲理了！只是一间食堂库房而已，我仔细听了，他的工厂根本就没开工，怎么突然就“另有他用”了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然租契还没签，但他明明都让我们付过定金了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在说不租就不租了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......人家不是把定金退给我们了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是生这个气。他刚才把钱往你怀里一扔，一点歉意都没有，那瞧不起人的样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是他毁约，不仅没个明白理由，连一句客气话都不肯讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们看着就那么好欺负吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说，他是不是想涨价钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不像吧？如果想涨价钱，他怎么不说呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定是想等咱们先开口，讲价钱的时候，谁先开口谁就吃亏，都是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......你是不是特别想要这一处呀，伊安？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是呀。毕竟你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，没什么。我是说，这里的位置、大小确实是最合适的，咱们一起花了那么多功夫才找到，好不容易谈下来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这是人家的地方，人家说了算......你就别不依不饶了，伊安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉拉，你怎么老向着那家伙说话呢？我才是跟你一边的呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你当然是，可你和我说这么多，我又有什么办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们两个老家伙，还拗得过人家大老板吗？你越说，我越是心烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，对不起，克拉拉。是我让你烦恼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们回头再见吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g6_dusklentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......直到今天，伊安都再没来互助会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......也后悔了，明明伊安是为我抱不平，我怎么对他说那样的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我太逆来顺受了......那个工厂老板毁约，我不敢说也不敢问，只一个劲唉声叹气，谁看了不生气呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊安有时也对我吞吞吐吐的。他是不是早就看不下去我这样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么就做不到像你一样呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克拉拉，你不用像我。如果我能像你一样温柔，可能琳蒂就不会那么怨恨我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少她会好过一点。也许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，谁都会有想抱怨自己的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。所以，你来找我，是想让我帮你解决这件事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有没有，我只是想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能陪我再去找一次那个老板？就是......帮我撑撑腰什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊安说得对，如果那个家伙是想讲价，那、那也不是不能讲讲。有你在，那家伙至少不会太嚣张，或者胡乱开价什么的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟现在能在海布里区开厂子的人，没有不认识你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能有个好结果，我也可以好好去和伊安道个歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那多出来的花销，你打算怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......如果不算过分，我可以自己补贴一点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，这样能行吗？会不会耽误你的正事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然会帮你，克拉拉。别说什么“正事”不“正事”的，别把我当成什么战争英雄，我就是你认识的织不好毛衣的凯瑟琳，没变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先去看看情况吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么又来了？定金不是都退给你了吗，我可不欠你什么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我想问问，如果我们愿意多出些租金呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看能不能，再考虑一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我看着像是缺你那点租金吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要什么价格，总归、总归可以谈一谈吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这老太太，怎么听不懂别人说话呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不租了就是不租了。我看你年纪大，才对你客气，你这样就有点不识抬举了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你管这样叫客气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还有个老......等等，你是那个，那个战争英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是凯瑟琳·弗莱彻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行吧。那你们想怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先说好，我已经不打算重新开工了。没有工人让你们串联。你们又能拿我怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，这本来就是我的合法财产，我想怎么处置就怎么处置。我和她连租约都没有签，她根本就不是我的租客，哪条法律也管不着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还给她退定金，已经够有良心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先说说不打算重新开工是怎么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你不会要和我说什么工作岗位之类的话吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是倒霉。在这个城市里，好心才是没有好报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来你也有麻烦。说不定我们能找到利益一致的地方，如果是那样，或许我也能帮到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你为什么要帮我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果帮你能对工人有好处，我为什么不帮你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，看来你不是那种只会大喊大叫的铁疙瘩脑袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你在意什么工作岗位的事，就之后来这里找哥伦比亚人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把工厂卖给了哥伦比亚人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不是工厂，只是厂房。这个工厂已经破产了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能不知道吧，“战争英雄”，战争胜利并不意味着我这样的人就能拿到贷款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能卖了厂房，就能抵押厂房，这些事我也懂一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，你不懂。那些哥伦比亚人不买我的厂房也会买别人的。以他们的价格，我和他们竞争，利润恐怕都不够付贷款利息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我撑了两年......战争胜利的时候我还挺高兴，我以为我撑过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我还能再撑几个月......我本来是这么想的。但是哥伦比亚人来了，就没有这个必要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或者你觉得我能招到只拿一半工资的工人吗，“工人领袖”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能。议会不会允许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，还不是你们在议会里搞什么“最低工资法案”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你破产了，还能卖了厂房拿一笔钱，回某个乡下别墅里舒舒服服地过活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工人的工资减半对工人来说意味着什么，你明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能不信，我其实明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能正是因为我明白这些事，我才会失败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者你运气不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工人没有义务也没有能力给你的坏运气买单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还是很讨厌和你们这些人说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不讨厌。你不算我见过最糟糕的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望这座城市里的人......能多交点好运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问过克拉拉你之前开的价钱，就像你说的，你确实不是为了租金才想把那间空库房租给她的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我当然也会想做点好事。老天允许的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜老天对我的好意不如我自己的良心厚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，我跟你们说这些干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，厂房我已经卖了。明白吗？别找我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我不是不想帮忙，是帮不上了”，你是这么想的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样，我有个提议，想听听吗？要是你愿意，你还是可以得到一些感谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"数日后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高个子工友","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！凯瑟琳，我这边搞定了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孬眼神工友","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，你小子能比我快？不可能不可能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高个子工友","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，一杯啤酒都输不起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都辛苦了，等会儿我请客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高个子工友","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别！他输了就是输了，就算凯瑟琳请客，他也得欠我这一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我请我的，他欠他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我请，我请。伯尼、加文，还有凯瑟琳，等会儿都上我家去，我来招待你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高个子工友","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是建个活动板房嘛，一抬手的事儿，你跟我们客气啥，克拉拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孬眼神工友","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，克拉拉，与其花钱给伯尼买啤酒，不如给孩子们买点吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高个子工友","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，那把你欠我的酒也换成面包交给克拉拉，我没意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么行，你们都出了力气了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉拉，他们两个今天是夜班，来不及去你家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......好吧，好吧，那就改天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那凯瑟琳呢，你总有时间吧？这次全都是托你的福......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪里能想到那个工厂老板竟然是个好人......那天你们说话的时候，我连大气都不敢出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好人吗......算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要在海布里区找一块空地，工厂外面是找不出来的，只有各个厂区的角角落落里还能有些零碎地皮。好在他只卖了厂房，没卖地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......等哥伦比亚人来了，我们不要紧吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没事。那天过来时我就看到这里了，这么一角地方，又窄又偏，原本也就只能堆放点杂物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后我们再把那边的砖墙补一段，和厂区隔开，两边互不打扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，这次租契都签好了，你还怕什么。现在的伦蒂尼姆，这点规矩总是可以有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是你有办法，凯瑟琳，还得是你有办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是这一两天帮点忙，比不上你一直照顾孩子辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都这把年纪了，又没有什么本事......说是我照顾孩子，不如说是我怕寂寞，想要孩子们陪着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我好像又说丧气话了，凯瑟琳，你不会不高兴吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会。我知道你就是这个性格，克拉拉。我心里觉得你了不起，不管你自己怎么说，我都是这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"出乎凯瑟琳的意料，克拉拉听到这句话，却像是想起了什么，瘪了瘪嘴巴，有点委屈的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你在想伊安。埋怨他和你生气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可能吧。他......有时候对着我，一副想说什么又不敢说的样子，他以为我看不出来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看得出他的心思，他当然也看得出你的。也许他有什么顾虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我总觉得他那天是想和我说什么，却又不肯说。结果一生气就是好几天，我也很委屈呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我说他让人心烦，确实是我不对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等把这里收拾干净了，我想请互助会的大家来聚一下......你说，伊安会来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你问我可没用，得问他才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"聚会当日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！克拉拉，我可以在这里种东西吗？老师让我们观察种子发芽，看，这是我带来的豌豆和罐头空罐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉着的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可别是想让罐头豌豆发芽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？我又不是傻子，这是我爸从杂货店买的新鲜豌豆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"淘气的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉拉克拉拉，我能种吗？可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以可以，那边堆了点砂土，你挖一点来种吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多孩子，你一个人照顾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平时不会有这么多，今天是有聚会，才都来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不是一个人，大家会轮流来帮忙的。我不像别人要去上工，时间多，就多照看一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊安也退休了，他会帮你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，他没来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......前天我上他家想和他说这件事，可他没在家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找对门的邻居帮忙留了口信......可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，他是不是躲着我呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克拉拉，你没考虑过和伊安商量商量吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商量？你是说......商量什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成个家，你们俩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊！你在说什么呀凯瑟琳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也不是一定要成家，但至少让他知道你喜欢他吧。别整天就你自己心里跌宕起伏的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊凯瑟琳，我、我，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......你不会以为我看不出来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我这把年纪的人了，说什么喜欢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你闷着不说，又有什么好处？说了，又有什么损失？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有这把年纪的人还谈这些的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“这把年纪”又不是脑子不转了、心不跳了，你爱和他待一块儿，关心他的事，见不到他了就愁眉苦脸，这不是明摆着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别人肯定要嚼舌根......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别人能说什么呢？你和伊安在互助会这些年，做了什么事，是什么样的人，大家都是看在眼里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照顾孩子是做好事呀。这件事可不一样，这多不知羞耻啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，凯瑟琳，我不是说你说得不对。我就是......我是说我自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说你自己“不知羞耻”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我了解你，你从来都是真心待人，对伊安也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真心怎么会羞耻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也知道我们“已经这把年纪”了，但这只让我觉得......要做什么，就抓紧去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们剩的时间又有多少，还有什么可顾忌的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是，可是他现在还在生我的气，怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊安是什么性格，你还不知道吗？和你一样的老好人。他怎么会一直和你生气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算今天没......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊安，伊安！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么走这么急呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老巴迪今天早上才告诉我......！他还笑嘻嘻的，说什么“差点忘了，克拉拉又来找你了”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那老东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你还在生我的气......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我那天是有点生气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......唉，没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别“没什么”了。你总把话咽回去，克拉拉心里就打起鼓了。这几天她可没少难过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，唉......我为什么特别希望互助会能在这里办，还不是因为......还不是因为，我想着，克拉拉是最经常照顾孩子们的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外看的几个地方，都离她的住处太远了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是以后孩子都上那些地方去，她每天得花多少时间来来回回？克拉拉腿脚不好，那么远的路，摔了碰了怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我是担心她，却、却被说烦人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有点儿伤心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......伊安......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......伊安，对不起！你知道我总是说错话......我不是真的那么想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。我当然知道。第二天我就没生气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你怎么不来互助会呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在外面跑，这几天。我想多凑点钱，再去问问那个老板，能不能再商量一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天老巴迪和我说我才知道，你和凯瑟琳已经把事情解决了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是凯瑟琳一出面，那家伙就不敢犯浑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那得看你觉得怎么样算犯浑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对了伊安，克拉拉好像有话和你说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉&伊安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉拉......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克拉拉的手不自觉地揪着外套下摆。\n一晃神，凯瑟琳好像又看到了多年前的克拉拉。\n那一天，克拉拉也是这样紧紧地揪着白色纱裙的下摆，说出那三个字时还打了磕巴。\n眼前的克拉拉，脸上已满是皱纹了。可此时那张脸庞上的神情，与四十年前穿着白纱裙的少女又有什么两样。\n克拉拉张了张嘴，什么也没说出来。\n空气像是变得有点黏稠......然后，她听见了克拉拉的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......伊安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳刚才和我说......不对，也不是凯瑟琳让我干什么，是我自己想说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊安，你说，咱们搭个伴......怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咱们......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克拉拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你不是总帮我吗？我觉得你很好......你觉得我怎么样呢？如果我和你......的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉拉......天啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么能让你来说......唉，我、我一直......我知道，你肯定......肯定很介意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，克拉拉！我真没想到你会......你愿意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然、我当然觉得你很好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们不再说话，只紧紧地握住彼此的手。\n孩子们吵吵嚷嚷的声音传了过来，凯瑟琳转过头，朝那边看了看。\n今天是个阴天，但她觉得，天色似乎比一个小时前更明亮了。\n不过，这也是当然的，现在是早上。\n太阳还会升得越来越高的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
